I agree that gold and gems should be hidden in the rock, this would be
fun if one had a pick-axe and a potion or spell of object detection.

I have another gripe about eating tins.  Once you try to eat a tin
and you get the prompt asking if you want to eat it, if you say no,
you should be left with an open tin of whatever that can be thrown
to your pet.  Right now a tin of dog biscuits would do no good, as
there is no way to throw the contents of a tin to a pet.


